CHANGELOG.md

# release-please rewrites HA manifests with indent=2 multi-line arrays; prettier
# would compact short arrays back to one line and fight every release PR.
custom_components/**/manifest.json

# Abbreviation definitions use `*[Term]: definition`. Prettier normalises `*`
# emphasis markers to `_`, producing `_[Term]:` — which is not the abbr syntax,
# so every definition silently stops resolving and no tooltips render.
includes/glossary.md

# Jinja templates. Prettier parses these as plain HTML, collapses the `{#- -#}`
# comments into the surrounding markup and reflows `{% %}` tags mid-line, which
# is both unreadable and easy to break.
overrides/
